        "quote": "Summary judgment was properly granted in this action where plaintiff alleges that she was injured when, while descending the staircase in defendant's building, she slipped and fell on a plastic bag that was on the staircase. There is no testimony that defendant created the condition by depositing the plastic bag on the stairwell.",
