        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "Furthermore, to the extent plaintiff argues that dim lighting in the staircase caused or contributed to her accident, the motion court correctly concluded that plaintiff did not, in her testimony, expressly link her accident to the alleged lack of lighting in the stairs.",
