        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "The plaintiff allegedly was injured when she tripped and fell while in a facility owned by the defendant ACJ Realty, LLC, and leased by the defendant Joseph M. Capo, M.D., P.C. (hereinafter Capo).",
        "statement_status": "allegation"
